{"input": "harness是什么意思，有什么作用", "status": "completed", "intent": {"clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": false, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "intents": ["question"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "", "relation": "new_topic", "workflow": null, "scope": "conversation", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户只是询问 harness 的含义和作用，没有领域上下文，属于普通知识问题，直接给通用解释并简述常见领域含义，不建立学习目标。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": false, "direct_teaching": false, "answer_only": true, "is_jd": false, "needs_verification": false, "cross_check_sources": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "", "light_reply": "“Harness”本义是“马具”，引申为“把各部分套在一起、统一驱动/约束的装置”。在技术语境里通常指一种把底层能力包起来、提供统一接口和可控环境的框架层。\n\n常见两种含义：\n- AI Agent 语境：agent harness 指围绕大模型搭的那层脚手架——负责循环调用模型、解析工具调用、管理上下文和权限、执行工具、记录轨迹等，让模型能真正“动手”完成任务。模型本身只输出文本，harness 决定它怎么行动、能做什么。\n- 测试语境：test harness 指让测试能自动跑起来的一套支撑代码和工具——准备测试数据、驱动被测代码、捕获结果、汇报成败。\n\n共同作用是：封装复杂度、提供统一入口、控制执行流程，让上层只关心“要做什么”，不用操心“怎么接起来”。如果你说的是某个具体场景里的 harness，可以告诉我上下文，我给更贴切的解释。", "session_tags": [], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "first_text_ms": 5499, "elapsed_ms": 7106, "search_state": "not_called", "replies": ["**Harness** 这个词要看领域，常见有两类含义。\n\n在**软件测试**里，它是「测试夹具/测试框架」：指为了让被测代码能独立运行而搭起来的一整套环境、依赖替换和驱动代码。作用是把测试对象与外部依赖隔离开，让测试可重复、可自动化。\n\n```python\n# 极简示例：用一个假的数据库替换真实依赖\ndef test_add_user():\n    db = FakeDB()                    # 这就是 harness 的一部分\n    service = UserService(db)\n    service.add(\"tom\")\n    assert db.saved == [\"tom\"]\n```\n\n在**电子/硬件**里，harness 指**线束**：把多根导线、连接器捆成一套，实现设备内部或之间的供电与信号连接。\n\n如果你指的是某个具体场景（如 AI 评测、汽车、嵌入式），告诉我领域，我再给对应的解释。"], "events": [{"stage": "received", "user_summary": "已保存，准备回应", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "understanding", "user_summary": "正在理解本轮意图", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "intent", "user_summary": "正在理解本轮意图", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "intent", "user_summary": "本步骤已完成", "duration_ms": 3175}, {"stage": "intent_decided", "user_summary": "已理解本轮要求", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "teaching_preparation", "user_summary": "正在梳理当前问题", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "teaching_preparation", "user_summary": "本步骤已完成", "duration_ms": 1546}, {"stage": "search_not_called", "user_summary": "本轮未调用网页检索", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "answer", "user_summary": "正在准备回答", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "answer", "user_summary": "本步骤已完成", "duration_ms": 2333}, {"stage": "sources", "user_summary": "来源类型已记录", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "learning_evidence", "user_summary": "学习记录已更新", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "completed", "user_summary": "本轮已回应", "duration_ms": null}], "providers": [], "sources": []}
{"input": "给刚才的 Agent harness 举个生活类比就好", "status": "completed", "intent": {"clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": false, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "intents": ["followup", "example"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "Agent harness 的生活类比解释", "relation": "continuation", "workflow": null, "scope": "conversation", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户要求给 Agent harness 举个生活类比，是对上一轮回答的追问与举例请求，属普通问题，直接解释即可，不建立训练目标。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": false, "direct_teaching": false, "answer_only": true, "is_jd": false, "needs_verification": false, "cross_check_sources": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "", "light_reply": "", "session_tags": [], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "first_text_ms": 4274, "elapsed_ms": 5534, "search_state": "not_called", "replies": ["如果你指的是 AI/Agent 领域的 harness，可以把它想成**宠物笼或婴儿围栏**。\n\n围栏本身不干任何事，但它在主人和宠物之间架了一圈边界，规定了「能去哪、不能去哪、多久喂一次、谁来收拾」。Agent 的 harness 也是这样：它包在模型外面，负责接住模型想做的动作，然后决定放不放行——比如能不能调工具、能读哪些文件、循环几次后强制停下、出错怎么重试。\n\n所以笼子不是宠物，围栏也不是它的能力；模型提供「想做什么」，harness 提供「允许做什么、怎么落地、做坏了怎么办」。换个笼子，同一只宠物能做的事就完全不同。"], "events": [{"stage": "received", "user_summary": "已保存，准备回应", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "understanding", "user_summary": "正在理解本轮意图", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "intent", "user_summary": "正在理解本轮意图", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "intent", "user_summary": "本步骤已完成", "duration_ms": 1749}, {"stage": "intent_decided", "user_summary": "已理解本轮要求", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "teaching_preparation", "user_summary": "正在梳理当前问题", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "teaching_preparation", "user_summary": "本步骤已完成", "duration_ms": 1526}, {"stage": "search_not_called", "user_summary": "本轮未调用网页检索", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "answer", "user_summary": "正在准备回答", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "answer", "user_summary": "本步骤已完成", "duration_ms": 2188}, {"stage": "sources", "user_summary": "来源类型已记录", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "completed", "user_summary": "本轮已回应", "duration_ms": null}], "providers": [], "sources": []}
{"input": "请搜索 Python 官方文档，核验 for 循环如何遍历列表，给出可点击的原始出处。", "status": "completed", "intent": {"clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": false, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "intents": ["question"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "", "relation": "new_topic", "workflow": null, "scope": "conversation", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户要求搜索 Python 官方文档核验 for 循环遍历列表并给出原始出处，属明确要求查证官方出处的概念问题，直接回答即可，不建立学习目标。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": false, "direct_teaching": false, "answer_only": true, "is_jd": false, "needs_verification": true, "cross_check_sources": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "Python 官方文档 for 循环遍历列表 tutorial", "light_reply": "", "session_tags": ["Python 基础"], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "first_text_ms": 17876, "elapsed_ms": 19402, "search_state": "verified", "replies": ["Python 官方文档对 `for` 语句的说明是：它用于“对序列（例如字符串、元组或列表）或其他可迭代对象中的元素进行迭代”。\n\n具体机制分三步：\n\n1. `in` 后面的表达式列表只被求值一次，产生一个可迭代对象。\n2. 系统为它创建一个**迭代器**。\n3. 按迭代器返回的顺序，每取出一项就**赋值给目标变量**，然后执行一次循环体；取完为止。\n\n例如 `for x in [10, 20, 30]:`，`x` 会依次绑定到 10、20、30，循环体执行三次。这里绑定的是**值**本身，不是列表的某个固定位置；循环对列表的修改也不会被循环自动跟踪，它只跟着迭代器要下一项。\n\n原始出处（我实际查阅的页面，版本为 Python 3.10）：\n\n- [8. 复合语句 — Python 3.10.20 文档](https://docs.python.org/zh-cn/3.10/reference/compound_stmts.html)，见其中“8.3. `for` 语句”一节。\n\n需要说明两点限制：该页面是 3.10 版本，不是最新版文档；其中也提到目标变量在循环结束后**不会被删除**，若序列为空则根本不会被赋值。"], "events": [{"stage": "received", "user_summary": "已保存，准备回应", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "understanding", "user_summary": "正在理解本轮意图", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "intent", "user_summary": "正在理解本轮意图", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "intent", "user_summary"